The [[Snow Stick]] is a neutral [[Weapon]] normally obtained by combining a [[Broom]] with a [[Snowball]], although it could also be obtained in the shop by [[Pyromancer]]s with the [[Frozen Flame]]. It deals mild-moderate damage, and inflicts {{icon/cold}} to '''both''' players on hit, but gives more to the opponent. 

The Snow Stick can be useful for a build that cares about the {{icon/cold}} of the opponent, with something like [[Frostbite]], [[Snowmaster]], or [[Frozen Flame]]. It helps to have a way to cleanse the self-inflicted {{icon/cold}}. Also consider the synergy with [[Harold, the Hateful Hat]] if playing [[Mage]].
